  "notes": "Verb type: {一段動詞|いちだんどうし} (ichidan verb)\nTransitivity: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive) - takes に for the person being flattered\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ～に{媚|こ}びる: to fawn over, curry favor with\n- {媚|こ}びを{売|う}る: to ingratiate oneself\n- {媚|こ}びへつらう: to fawn and flatter (compound verb)\n\nCONNOTATION:\nUsually negative, suggesting insincerity or excessive obsequiousness.",
